## Artifact-first completion and handoff

- Write the required artifact to `${artifact_path}`. Prefer a temporary file in
  the same directory, validate it, and atomically rename it into place.
- Finish the artifact with the exact marker `${completion_marker}`.
- After the artifact and marker are complete, send exactly one short native prompt
  to `${handoff_target}`:
  `Task ${task_id}: artifact ${artifact_path}; marker ${completion_marker}.
  Please continue coordinator acceptance.`
- Do not poll for completion, inspect a transcript in a loop, run a background
  watcher, send a second Enter, or blindly resend the handoff. If the handoff
  fails, record that fact in the artifact and make no delivery claim.

